    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Don't use TPM to audit sites you are not authorized to audit. Don't attempt to circumvent device fingerprinting or licensing.</p>
    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>Pro and Team subscriptions: pro-rated refund within 14 days of first upgrade via email to support@usetpm.dev.</p>
    <h2>Termination</h2>
    <p>Either party may cancel at any time. On cancellation, your device downgrades to Free tier and history sync stops; local artifacts remain yours.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
